## E-mail sent when someone approving an item request, requests that the Item
## or Bitstream be made public.
##
## Parameters: {0} the name of the requested bitstream, or "all"
##             {1} Handle URL of the requested Item
##             {2} title of the requested Item
##             {3} the unique token which identifies the item request
##             {4} the name of the approver
##             {5} the approver's email address
## See org.dspace.core.Email for information on the format of this file.
##
#set($subject = "${config.get('dspace.name')}: Request for Open Access")

${params[4]}, with address ${params[5]},
requested the following document/file to be in Open Access:

Document Handle: ${params[1]}
File ID: ${params[0]}
Token: ${params[2]}

The ${config.get('dspace.name')} Team
